      "path": "src/ui/cockpit/replay/close-review-walk.tsx",
      "content": "Guard the save handler against read-only state as well as disabling the normal submit button. After answers have been entered, the runtime can become non-writable (for example following a rejected write). Closing the walk still opens `Refusal`, whose “Save it” action calls this handler and is disabled only while pending, so it can issue another write while the shell is read-only. Return without submitting when `!writable` (and when locked), and cover changing the runtime to read-only before choosing “Save it”.",
