    },
    {
      "path": "src/ui/cockpit/replay/close-review-walk.tsx",
      "content": "The answer controls remain editable while a save is pending. `submit` receives the answers from the start of the request, but the user can subsequently change the lesson or selected option; when that request resolves, the parent replaces the walk with the saved reflection, silently losing those edits. Include `pending` in the controls' disabled condition and add a deferred-submit test verifying that answers cannot change before the request finishes.",
